# Agent worktrees — the harness creates a full checkout per subagent under here.
# Not ignoring them means git, magit and every project-file walker see N copies of
# the whole repository (16 of them, 191M, measured 2026-08-20), and gopls offers to
# run govulncheck once per newly-appearing go.mod. "Always" cannot suppress that,
# because each worktree is a new path and therefore a new module every time.
/.claude/worktrees/

# fossil checkout marker — the whole tree is snapshotted in
# ~/work/fossil/mini-spec.fossil (see CLAUDE.local.md), opened over this checkout
.fslckout
